Third-party notice
------------------
The model structure implemented in src/itransformer_repro/models.py follows
the official iTransformer repository (https://github.com/thuml/iTransformer),
which is released under the MIT License. The implementation here was rewritten
for teaching purposes: it removes the upstream experiment framework, adds
configuration switches for ablation studies, and unifies training/evaluation
code. Dataset files are not distributed with this repository; see
data/README.md for their official sources.
